OL,3,GNEWSAMixed feelings as beach cafe
OL,4,Agranted temporary lease
OL,5,
OL,6,FDan Astin-Gregory, a local resident who
OL,7,Fset up the petition, said: "We welcome
OL,8,Fanother summer season for SOBO Beach,
OL,9,Fwhich we love. But the decision has
OL,10,Fmixed feelings because it still shows
OL,11,Fthat the council's proceeding with its
OL,12,Fpreferred bidder."
